{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-19_end",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-19",
  "title": "殷红君主",
  "storyCode": "13-21",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-19_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d172c93aa80b5bef9fd97c70d30c933d24e6a24cb5bca917412cf25a1b840394",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "43_g3_giantmonsterspinetop"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瞧瞧，瞧瞧你们自己狼狈的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "左支右绌，顾此失彼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕无人回应你们的号哭，也别浪费了这片舞台，别浪费了最后告别的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“我陈述，则为我规定。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“风雨止歇，无权流动。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你呵止了奔腾本身？很精彩，血为你驻足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但——我才是它们的主人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "丧钟会溃朽，规程将疲敝，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若你如此不屑于自己身负的高贵血脉，我会将它们抽取而出，送还给你的母亲，女妖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她会为你奏起哀悼的哨音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是你的血吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "靠你的法术而炽热，靠你的天赋而炽热。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我所见过的热血——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——都是为了反抗，都是为了活命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些人的血，比你炽热得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......阿米娅，退回来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他避开了要害！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多么冷酷啊，魔王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是一位寡恩之主。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "血魔大君，鲜血王庭的主人，你的子裔填满了萨卡兹所在的每一片战场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你总向他们宣称，杀戮和征伐就是血魔古老的传统。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你将自己的王庭塑造成了如今的样子。你让所有人眼中的血魔，都如你自己一般只余下扭曲的欲望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我认识的血魔，不止你一人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们不曾与你一样疯狂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们只是将自己的渴求隐藏得很好，他们只是被这个失去家园的时代规训得太深。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总有人选择匍匐于侵略者的脚下，我为他们遗憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "血魔大君，你如何诠释自己王庭所代表的鲜血？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨卡兹的苦难何须多言，每一个萨卡兹，哪怕臣服于你们的那些，都不免饱尝血的滋味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被人掀翻在暗巷，被人堵截在密林，有时是咽喉被割断，有时则是肋骨间被刺入冰冷的匕首。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而他的兄弟姐妹也将因此得以转醒，得以明白屈服的代价，于是他们反抗，直到自己也身披敌人的血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多可悲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杀死别人，或自己被人杀死，这就是萨卡兹所背负的，血的循环。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“血的循环”，这就是你所定义的，鲜血的意义？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们第一次被血沾湿身体，难道不是......从母体中诞生吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "血是人们维生的根本，血是脐带连接的传承，血是探索外界时难免的磕绊，和必将愈合的伤口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你却只将它们视作折磨与死亡的代称。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的偏执使得你嗜血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以你的骄横与傲慢使他们相信，这才是萨卡兹原本就该行的道，该做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我否决你，血魔大君。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我否决你的行动，你的言语，你的王庭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈！我听到了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你，一个异族，否决我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "区区一顶王冠，让你膨胀到了什么地步——“魔王”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不在乎我是什么，我被称为什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只知道，我需要做些什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就是这么玩弄“魔王”能力的吗，卡特斯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你打算说些什么大道理，又要用怎样肤浅的情感来尝试动摇我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你大可尝试。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我否定你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我否定你，将“魔王”，将萨卡兹，将卡兹戴尔归结为力量与传统。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我否定你，把未来寄托给过去，把生命寄托于杀戮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西娅小姐，魔王，议长，巴别塔的领袖，曾给所有人看过一条道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许，那条道路过于理想；也许，她的承诺承载不住萨卡兹延绵千年万年的仇恨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但绝不是现在，你的选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想笑我懦弱？指责我不配与你谈论萨卡兹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是想嘲笑Logos先生此刻依然不打算借用你“唤醒”的血脉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哦，“魔王”。偷听我脑海里的思维，就是你的能耐了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你自然知晓我要说些什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我们从未说过，萨卡兹应当放弃反抗。我们从未说过，苦难理所应当。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正相反——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自煎熬和苦难之中，自仇恨和深渊之中觉醒的反抗者们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "会比你强大得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨卡兹们所失落的家园，不在你一遍遍回望的、那些万年前的历史中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它不该是一句口号，一个空想，一个象征。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它就在这里，就在萨卡兹们来的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那座名为卡兹戴尔的城市里，明明就生活着如此之多真实存在的人，而你们却只将他们葬送在了一个虚无的理念里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你用过去臆想现在，那真正的未来就永远不可能降生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "停下吧，血魔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "连特蕾西娅都失败了，而你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，特蕾西娅小姐才需要我。博士和凯尔希医生才需要我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我才在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如死魂灵所说的，如你所说的，如诸多萨卡兹所认为的那般——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "异族的——弱小的——“魔王”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让开吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "43_g3_giantmonsterspinetop"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你已经没办法战斗了，血魔大君。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "战斗该结束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“魔王”，你不为我赐下那虚无的愿景吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不想窥知我的所思所想，我的所哀所苦吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以申饬我，你可以否定我，万千萨卡兹都相信，这就是魔王的权力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你指控我败坏我的王庭，那你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“魔王”，萨卡兹以你所指之处为路，以你所行之道为途，我的同胞们追随着你，期待你善加利用他们的血与肉，他们的生命与灵魂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种盲目的信仰，可笑至极。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我对魔王的抚慰嗤之以鼻，但我......曾见过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的兄长，亦曾是魔王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“魔王”，呵，多么尊崇的名号，多么超绝的地位——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他被视为萨卡兹的领袖，我们的道标。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他是天生的拯救者，他是能将我们拉出苦厄的那双手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可事实又是如何呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑色王冠所挑选的，又是怎样的一群人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在最开始，魔王确实是伟岸的，炎魔踏上谴罚之路，歌利亚咆哮无畏之灾——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可他们却总被怯懦者背叛，被自私者出卖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是我们的诅咒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“魔王......杀死了魔王。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这顶王冠的更迭，往往伴随着死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卑劣者总是胜出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "于是，王冠被愚蠢和短视污染了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魔王之中，开始出现软弱之人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们狭隘，他们醉心于玩弄手中的权术——他们变得和神民与先民那些虚伪的领主并无不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "窃取而来的权力使他们再也无法认清自己，我的同胞们信仰的对象，也从无畏的战士，变成了躲藏在王宫里的蠹虫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们甚至忘记了——萨卡兹这个名字背负的耻辱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而王冠却还是在做出可笑的选择，直到我的兄长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我原以为，他会是我们久盼而来的那位英雄！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而他，居然胆敢向我声称，萨卡兹们已经无力继续承担战争，修复卡兹戴尔需要几代人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "连我们脚下这具骸骨都知道，我们该修复的卡兹戴尔绝不该是一座城市。而“魔王”，才应是站在所有人面前的那个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他这样的人，身体里怎么配容纳那一滴提卡兹的血！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看到了吗，魔王！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到......一场洒满了鲜血的内乱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "王宫的地毯都被浸透染红。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看见，一个......血魔，倒在另一个血魔怀中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“覆血王子”的传说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他卒于一场内乱，而你是他的骨肉手足，你参与了那场叛乱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不！当然不！“参与者”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仅我一人，即让王冠碎裂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我仍记得那个场面，我的手贯穿了他的胸膛。提卡兹澄澈的血在我的指尖飞舞，最终没入了我的血管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他扭头看向我，扯住我的衣服......“魔王”在死前却对行凶者展现了本该赐予功臣的虚幻愿景。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在那幅愿景里，我曾看见......我也曾目睹，“安宁”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正如你所说，卡特斯，鲜血不只等同于死亡。我站在山谷之间，看着一个平静的村庄，医生一边谈笑，一边为伤者缝合伤口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "受伤的人告诉医生，最近的猎物格外凶猛，但他最终还是赢下了那场搏斗。院子里，挂着新鲜收获的兽肉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......而那医生就是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可这让我更加怒不可遏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多么悲哀，多么虚无，多么可耻！我的兄长，居然以为，这种虚假的“安宁”就能蒙蔽我？他大错特错！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他以为我被仇恨冲昏了头脑？不，我知晓什么是平静，正因为这样，我才更加躁动！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们渴望看到，真正强大的提卡兹！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我将兄长的血纳入己躯，我眼看着黑色的王冠在我眼前消逝——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可你并未荣登“魔王”之位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我并不可惜。倘若它能选中强大的领袖，我反而由衷庆幸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可这顶王冠却一次又一次让我失望。更加失望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我兄长的继任者是一个，流浪汉。再之后，是个樵夫。要不是赦罪师带回的卷宗，这些人，根本不配被铭记。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之后的再一位入主卡兹戴尔的魔王被那只名为凯尔希的怪物杀死，倒在联军之前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "随后，是特蕾西娅和特雷西斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们令人高看一眼，却又让人心生焦躁，只耽于空想的特蕾西娅白白浪费了她的强大，像极了我那......软弱的兄长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而她的继任者......居然已沦落到是一只异族的卡特斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然如此，既然王冠的选择总是如此荒诞，它的存在却又总是给我的同胞们带去可耻的希望——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，我就在文明之外葬送它。我就让它真的彻底遗落于历史之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还在挣扎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅，别给他机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也衰弱了。也是。王冠再怎么蒙受玷污，其重量也不是你这样一个婴孩般的卡特斯所能承受的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来那些等着摆弄王冠的赦罪师们又要对我絮叨些废话了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......重新看看这里吧，卡特斯。你若是死了，便不会再有任何“继任者”了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是说，你能把你的王冠给月亮戴上吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么......？他怎么可能还能战斗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魔王的术法已经深入他的身躯之内，他的躯体本应已无法再生才对！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他在用血填补缺失的肉身，用血缝合伤痕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他已是悬丝傀儡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在越发熟练地运用魔王的力量，卡特斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，你的一切劝诫、警告、审判、宣言，都是笑话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无知的小兔子，你头顶的王冠，并不代表任何职责或权能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“魔王”，呵。我嘲弄魔王的愚蠢，不仅仅是在嘲弄你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有，这顶王冠本身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当萨卡兹们失去了可供仰赖的魔王，他们也许终会从这个苦等救赎的，卑怯的梦中醒来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我承认你说的，自深渊中觉醒的人将更加强大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正因如此，你们无法胜过我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨卡兹已经堕落的意志，怎么能抵挡曾承载提卡兹鲜血的我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "肮脏无法污蔑纯洁，恶浊无法染指澄澈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提卡兹既是你们的来路，你们就只能在这条延长线上攀缘！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们才是反抗者！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“我划定，即为我纠正。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“血与火将熄灭，正视灭亡。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Logos先生，小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他的血，对我，产生了影响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比那些法阵强大数倍——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，多亏了你们，我也在这里流淌下了我的血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也正因为如此——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里也被纳入了卡兹戴尔之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁能想到，当所有人都认为这片大地的全貌已经展露殆尽......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "家园的边界却仍在拓展。哪怕此时此地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨卡兹，我自称萨卡兹的同胞啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟上血液的行军，跟上永不会背叛你们的，血脉中的馈赠！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会将你们带去，这一切的起点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那里会是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，萨卡兹的馈赠，与我无关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小兔子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你*萨卡兹粗口*又不是萨卡兹，动起来！削弱他的束缚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在做！他的法术比想象中——更疯狂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我几乎听不见他的心声了，那里......那里只有一片猩红......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就要......抓住了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又一个异族......这倒是出乎意料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你鲜血的气息，你是卡普里尼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无趣的伪装......就让你的血绞死你自己吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们觉得凭这种粗浅的法术，就能够杀死一位萨卡兹的王庭之主？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然不能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别把屠杀的陈词滥调称作“觉醒”，血魔大君。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还在仇恨和毁灭之中兜兜转转的你，从来没有离开过所谓的“深渊”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还没睡醒的，是你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——卑劣的叛徒——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魔王！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是现在！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "趁他没有恢复以前，把他从骸骨上击落！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我刚践祚王庭时，丧钟已与我的命运相连。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们都不能逃过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但挽歌哀悼的不会是你的身躯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而是与你我相连的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——不会——女妖——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅，与我合奏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去窥探挽歌的弦音。去寻觅女妖的起点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看向我。看向你曾捂耳避讳的哀嚎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们必须将他终结在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会尝试！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女妖！听听吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还是——承应了你的血脉，我的赐福——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还是，没有打败你自己！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多可笑......就连众魂都在嘲弄我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女妖之主，还有......“魔王”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你们把这些无视过去的驳杂者留在身边，在最后，你们甚至不敢自己动手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......卑劣者，总是胜出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这确实是我们的诅咒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "异族的魔王处决了我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魔王与丧钟共鸣。但你们却不知，血色的联系有多么坚韧，就妄图宣判......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，你们最后，终于还是用出了血脉之中的力量！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "两位挽歌歌者同时为我献上悼亡曲——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们终归，还是敌不过构成你们一切的，来自血脉中的本能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们真的杀死了我吗？不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已经把提卡兹的血还给故乡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去看吧，去伦蒂尼姆看看——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（轻如耳语的萨卡兹语）我在毁灭的帷幕后等着你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
